I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and that clause is the authority the build checks, so importing `http-client` would fail the same way it did before. The fetch would also send each kept item's title to an external host, which the node's output doesn't reflect. If the platform team has extended the grant, the `with` clause needs that change first. Once it does, the enrichment call can be added back.

